data-tex=\"i,s\\in\\omega\">\\(i,s\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}movable-markers}\\vdash\nb_i(s):=\\min\\{z:\\ z\\notin B_s\\land|\\{v&lt;z:v\\notin B_s\\}|=i\\},\\qquad\nb_i(s)\\le b_i(s+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}movable-markers}\\vdash\nb_i(s):=\\min\\{z:\\ z\\notin B_s\\land|\\{v&lt;z:v\\notin B_s\\}|=i\\},\\qquad\nb_i(s)\\le b_i(s+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段的补集无限，因此每个标记都存在；补集删去元素后，第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个剩余数不会降低。若第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个标记被反复枚举进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，它严格上移；标记本身的索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 与当前自然数位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\">\\(b_i(s)\\)</span> 不能混同。</p>\n<p>来源：§4.3.2；式 (4.1)；印刷页 87；PDF 第 123 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","